#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
BLADE v4 — Multi-Instrument 15m ORB + Multi-Strategy Framework
2026-03-24

Instruments:
  SPX500_USD — ASIA (00:00 UTC) + NY (13:30 UTC) + NY PM (18:00 UTC)
  DE30_EUR   — London (08:00 UTC)
  XAU_USD    — Any session, ONLY when Lens confidence >= 65%

TWO TRADING MODES (can be active simultaneously on different instruments):

MODE A — Daily ORB (runs every session, always):
  Standard 1 unit | TP1=15 / TP2=20 / TP3=30 pips | SL=opposite ORB level
  1m confirmation candle | ADR not extreme | No score gate

MODE B — Swing Trade (score >= 70 only):
  risk-based sizing | TP1=30 / TP2=50 / TP3=100 pips | SL=H4 structure level
  Uses Strategist bias direction

FOUR STRATEGIES PER SESSION (max 1 trade each, sequential):
  1. ORB breakout    — first 30 min
  2. Sweep fade      — post-ORB (30-60 min) — score >= 50
  3. EMA pullback    — mid-session, trend continuation — score >= 50
  4. Momentum entry  — any time, prior-session-range breakout — score >= 50
  + Swing            — any time — score >= 70

SCORE AS MODE SELECTOR (not trade gate):
  < 50  : ORB only, standard lots
  50-69 : ORB + additional strategies, standard lots
  >= 70 : all above + Swing mode (risk-based sizing, wider TPs)

Paper trade only.
"""

